{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "02163020-422c-8236-b276-ad445d52a530",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T11:31:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. Merry Christmas Eve, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Tony, thank you. Merry Christmas to you too. I'm calling about my water and sewer account. I want to change the mailing address, and I want to go paperless. Is that something you can do on the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure can. Let me pull up the account. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 328 Marsh Street, in the Point. The name on it is Bridget Dolan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 328 Marsh Street, Dolan. Got it. And what's the new mailing address you want the bills to go to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's a P.O. box now. I'll give it to you slowly, yes? Box 214, Newport, Rhode Island, 02840."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Box 214, Newport, 02840. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. Thank you. And the paperless, that means no more paper bill in the mail at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, instead you'd get it by email. Do you have an email you want on file?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Can I send it to you in a minute? I have to find it in my phone, I don't remember it exactly. [pause] Actually, can you tell me how it gets set up first? You email me, and then I click something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pretty much. I'll note the email on the account, and the next bill notice goes there with a link. You'd just open the link to see the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. So no paper at all, only the link. I understand. Here is the email, I'm reading it from the screen. [pause] Okay, I'm going to tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead, I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the line was cutting, one second. You know what, I'll do the email through the website instead and just be sure the address change is done today. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. I'll make the mailing address change now, and you can add the email on the website for the paperless part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, thank you. Another question. My last bill was high, and I had a plumber come out recently. I kept the receipt. Do you need it from me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not for the address change. If you want someone to look at the high bill, hold on to the receipt and mention it when we review the usage. Do you remember when the plumber was there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it was a Monday. Was it the ninth or the nineteenth? Let me check. The receipt says the ninth. Monday the ninth. But wait, is the ninth a Monday? December ninth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "December ninth this year was a Tuesday. The Monday would be the eighth, and the Monday after next is the fifteenth. The nineteenth was a Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So I read it wrong. Let me look again. [pause] It says the eighth. Monday the eighth. Sorry, my eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:30:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. December eighth, I'll note that on the account."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:31:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Last thing. If I want to pay and your office is closed, is there a drop box for payments? After you close, I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a drop box at City Hall for payments. Put in a check with your account number or bill stub, and don't leave cash. You can also pay online through the city's website anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So a check in the box, with the account number. And the website anytime. Okay, I got it. Thank you very much, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. The mailing address is updated. Have a good holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T11:31:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
